    "id": 734433,
    "branch": "hackweek_project_outpost",
    "changeset": "b24309",
    "created": "2026-11-16T01:31:14.5",
    "message": "Extraction: add CZ-721 backstory and record mission plans\n* Add optional conversations about CZ-721's stolen suit, printed ID and real name.\n* Connect Waterworks repairs to Outpost's water supply and medical shop stock.\n* Keep backstory accessible after completion while preserving mission eligibility and rewards.\n* Record Vagabond's weapons-shop arc, construction project and future monument missions.\n\nValidation: Unity conversation validator, imported localization and nine lore return-path checks passed. Gameplay assets for the future missions and shops remain unchanged.",
    "user": "Pilgrim"
  },
  {
    "id": 734431,
    "branch": "hackweek_project_outpost",
    "changeset": "a750f7",
    "created": "2026-11-16T00:11:26.7",
    "message": "Extraction: refine mission interactions and preserve safe-pocket items\n* Add hold-E mission interactions with movement and camera locking, target-anchored progress, and reset on cancellation.\n* Make ledger and maintenance-log reads take five seconds, and consume repair materials only after completion.\n* Refine the compact mission card, grow it for wrapped text, and add completion audio, right-aligned ticks and task transitions.\n* Use Water Treatment's existing pipe-access pit and valve for feedline repairs and pressure release.\n* Preserve safe-pocket contents when they load before the saved backpack.\n* Validate Unity compilation, 17 server tests, and in-game HUD and interaction checks.",
    "user": "Pilgrim"
  },
